<title>USA: Aetrium Inc to acquire Forward Systems.</title>
<headline>Aetrium Inc to acquire Forward Systems.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aetrium Inc said Tuesday it signed an agreement to acquire the assets of Forward Systems Automation Inc, a maker of automated test handlers and other equipment for the semiconductor industry.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed. The deal is expected to close early in the second quarter, Aetrium said.</p>
<p>Aetrium supplies proprietary technology and equipment used in the semiconductor manufacturing industry.</p>
<p>Its shares were up 1/4 Tuesday at 13-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
